source -[#334155]-> seed : A1 build input
seed -[#334155]-> core : A1 parse and elaborate once
core -[#334155]-> images : A1 deterministic compile
images -[#334155]-> generated : A1 verified AOT specialization
source -[#334155]-> generated : A1 self-parse
generated -[#334155]-> fixed : A1 regenerate core and images
core -[#7C3AED,dashed]-> fixed : A4 byte/fingerprint equality
images -[#7C3AED,dashed]-> fixed : A4 byte/fingerprint equality
fixed -[#334155]-> bundle : A1 admit only fixed point
bundle -[#334155]-> frontend : A1 production initialization
frontend -[#334155]-> adapter : A1 canonical compile result
adapter -[#334155]-> host : A1 check_commit

guest -[#334155]-> handle : A1 validate and install
handle -[#334155]-> flt : A1 exact parser dispatch
flt -[#334155]-> kernel : A1 parse/construct/match/reduce
bundle -[#334155]-> kernel : A1 host theory and checker ABI
kernel -[#334155]-> adapter : A1 transition/effect/grade receipts

source -[#DC2626,dashed]-> host : A5 ✗ no source reparse or second evaluator
guest -[#DC2626,dashed]-> generated : A5 ✗ no ambient host-grammar mutation
handle -[#DC2626,dashed]-> host : A5 ✗ language rights do not mint funds

note bottom of fixed
