  |<#E0E7FF> | **P3** Canonical in-Rholang specification data |
  |<#DCFCE7> | **P5** Canonical language core |
  |<#BFDBFE> | **P8** Verified derived images and runtime host substrate |
  |<#C7D2FE> | **P13** Generated parser and scoped FLT surface |
  |<#A7F3D0> | **P9** Fail-closed verification and semantic kernel |
  |<#FBCFE8> | **P10** Committed bundle or opaque handle identity |
  |<#DBEAFE> | **P4** Neutral frontend seam |
  |<#DDD6FE> | **P11** Host adapter and resource projection |
  |<#F1F5F9> | **P14** Fixed-point scope and compatibility note |
  |<#334155> | **A1** Ordinary dataflow |
  |<#7C3AED> | **A4** Proof / equality obligation (dashed) |
